senses.gloss:
--a semi-celestial group, usually of the class of demons; born of विश्वा and कश्यप;
1: भा. II. 6. १३; VI. 8. २४; X. 6. २७; ६२. १९; ८५. ४१; Br. II. ३२. 1-2; ३५. १९१; ३६. ११८; M. 6. ४६.
followers of Rudra (शिव), their overlord; their lord, Kubera;
2: भा. IV. १०. 5; XI. १६. १६; २३. २४; M. 8. 5.
milked the cow- earth, with वैश्रवण as the calf and आम as the vessel;
3: Ib. १०. २२.
worship the बर्हिषद् manes;
4: Ib. १५. 4.
helped वृत्र against Indra and went with सती to दक्ष's sacrifice;
5: भा. VI. १०. २०; IV. 4. 4, ३४.
sport of;
6: Ib. X. ९०. 9.
got मोक्ष meditating on Hari;
7: Ib. VII. 7. ५०.
usurped the आनर्त kingdom of Kakudmi when he was absent at ब्रह्मा's court;
8: Ib. IX. 3. ३६.
came with the gods to see कृष्ण and saw कृष्ण retiring to his own region;
9: Ib. VII. 8. ३८; XI. ३१. 2.
(see पुण्यजनस्); vanquished by रावण;
१०: Br. III. 7. २५५.
worship the पितृस् and ruin the श्राद्ध;
११: Ib. III. १०. ३८, १११; ११. ८१; IV. 2. २६; १४. 4; २०. ५०; ३०. 9; ३३. ७५.
their kingdom;
१२: M. २३. ३९; १२१. ४८.
their loka;
१३: Br. IV. ३९. ५६.
the nails of वामन when he grew.
